                "text": "When I received a request from AnMed to help with funding for a new emergency department, it made perfect sense to me. \n\nThis state of the art and full-service facility in Piedmont will improve access to much-needed health care in an underserved part of the I-85 corridor, including Anderson, Greenville and Pickens counties. \n\nI appreciate all the hard work that went into making this a reality, and I\u2019m glad to have been a partner in this effort.",
